OL,3,GNEWSADormice 'thrive' at National Trust
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FHabitat work and a monitoring scheme
OL,7,Fhave helped hazel dormice thrive at a
OL,8,FNational Trust site, despite declines
OL,9,Felsewhere, experts have said.
OL,11,FKillerton National Trust has 100 nest
OL,12,Fboxes across its estate in Devon.
OL,13,FRangers weigh and record details of
OL,14,Feach mouse between April and October.
OL,16,FThe trust said the animals "continue to
OL,17,Fthrive" in the area - a sign it was
OL,18,F"doing something right" by creating a
OL,19,F"healthy, diverse and well-connected
OL,20,Fhabitat for wildlife".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
