OL,3,GNEWSADormice 'thrive' at National Trust
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe People's Trust for Endangered
OL,7,FSpecies said populations had declined
OL,8,Fby over two thirds in the UK since
OL,9,F2000. Experts said the decline was
OL,10,Flargely down to "habitat
OL,11,Ffragmentation".
